@startuml
' ============================================================
' 图13 遛狗区预约对象 状态图
' 优化点：提高分辨率、放大字号、分离失败分支、加大间距
' ============================================================
skinparam dpi 300
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam nodesep 90
skinparam ranksep 95

skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #2563EB
  BorderThickness 1.8
  FontSize 16
  FontStyle bold
  FontColor #1E293B
}

skinparam arrow {
  Color #475569
  Thickness 1.6
  FontSize 14
  FontColor #1E40AF
}

state "Initial\n待提交" as Initial #EFF6FF
state "CONFIRMED\n已确认" as CONFIRMED #DCFCE7
state "CANCELLED\n已取消" as CANCELLED #F1F5F9
state "COMPLETED\n已完成" as COMPLETED #DBEAFE

[*] --> Initial

Initial -right-> CONFIRMED : 提交预约成功\n(原子扣减名额)
Initial --> [*] : 提交失败\n(名额已被占用)

CONFIRMED -down-> CANCELLED : 业主在开始前取消
CONFIRMED -down-> COMPLETED : 预约时段到达

CANCELLED --> [*]
COMPLETED --> [*]

' 强制"已取消"在左、"已完成"在右
CANCELLED -[hidden]right-> COMPLETED

@enduml
